","status":"modified"}],"audit":"schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\ndecision: pass\navailability: available\ninput_trust: caller_supplied\ndigest: 97b08aa83161cbd2825fced1d94aad6e7d48826ec2dfda497192a3d12763f138\nchanged_files_count: 3\nfindings_count: 0\n\nNo blocking findings found in supplied diff.","risk":"ARCHITECTURE_SENSITIVE","governing":["The human may stop computation at any time, but only an explicit authority decision can satisfy an authority boundary","A candidate is kept or removed by decision, and its evidence is recorded before anything is removed","The reviewer judges the whole candidate, including files the worker created"]}}
